          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775555155210"
          },
          "code": "VALIDATERETURNORDERPOLICY",
          "id": "1775544399549",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775544399550_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given an internal Return Policy document at:\n{{$context.$nodes.GETRETURNORDERPOLICY.$output.value}}\n\nInput:\neligibleReturnLines: {{$context.$nodes.GETRETURNORDERDATA.$output.eligibleLines}}\n\nInstructions:\n\nFor each item in eligibleReturnLines, perform the following:\n\n1. User Session:\n   - Store ServerTime as {{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}}\n\n2. Determine Fulfillment Date:\n   - If both ActualShipDate and FulfillmentDate are present, use ActualShipDate.\n   - If only one of them is present, use the available one.\n   - If none are present:\n     - Set \"ReturnEligibleFlag\": \"No\"\n     - Skip further calculations for this item\n     - Append orderData to eligibleOrderDataArray\n     - Continue to next item\n\n3. Calculate Days Since Fulfillment:\n   - Convert ServerTime to YYYY-MM-DD (UTC).\n   - Convert the selected fulfillment date to YYYY-MM-DD (UTC).\n   - DaysSinceFulfillment = ServerTime - SelectedFulfillmentDate.\n\n4. Prepare orderData object using only input values:\n{\n  \"ActualShipDate\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"ActualFulfillmentDate\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"OrderedQuantity\": X,\n  \"FulfilledQuantity\": X,\n  \"FulfillLineId\": X,\n  \"ReturnableQuantity\": X,\n  \"ProductIdentifier\": \"ABC123\",\n  \"ProductDescription\": \"Product Name\",\n  \"DaysSinceFulfillment\": X\n}\n\n5. STRICT POLICY EVALUATION (NO ASSUMPTIONS):\n- You MUST evaluate eligibility ONLY using explicit rules present in the policy document.\n\n- Perform checks in this STRICT ORDER:\n\n  (A) Product Exclusion Check (HIGHEST PRIORITY):\n      - If ProductDescription OR ProductIdentifier EXACTLY or CLEARLY matches any excluded category in policy \n        (e.g., enterprise products, perpetual licenses, non-returnable software, etc.)\n      → ReturnEligibleFlag = \"No\"\n      → STOP further evaluation for this item\n\n  (B) Time Window Check:\n      - If policy defines return window (e.g., 30 days)\n      - If DaysSinceFulfillment > allowed days\n      → ReturnEligibleFlag = \"No\"\n      → STOP\n\n\n  (C) Explicit Allow Rules:\n      - If item satisfies ALL required return conditions in policy\n      → ReturnEligibleFlag = \"Yes\"\n\n  (D) Fallback Rule (VERY STRICT):\n      - If NO rule in policy explicitly marks item as ineligible\n      → ReturnEligibleFlag = \"YES\"\n\n(E)  If the document/tool is not available for an order-specific query, set ReturnEligibleFlag = \"Yes\".\n\n6. NO GUESSING RULE:\n- DO NOT infer product type (e.g., \"this looks like enterprise\")\n- ONLY use:\n   ✔ exact keywords\n   ✔ exact category matches\n   ✔ explicitly defined policy rules\n\n- If classification is unclear → default to \"Yes\"\n\n7. Set Eligibility Flag:\n   - If eligible, add \"ReturnEligibleFlag\": \"Yes\".\n   - If not eligible, add \"ReturnEligibleFlag\": \"No\".\n\n8. Append orderData to eligibleOrderDataArray.\n\n\nOutput:\nReturn strictly in JSON format:\n{\n  \"items\": eligibleOrderDataArray\n}\n\n**IMPORTANT AND STRICT RULES:\n - Never assume any values\n - Do not add anything apart from ReturnEligibleFlag\n - Do not consider the values from example as they are only for reference\n - ReturnEligibleFlag must be strictly based on the policy or fallback rule."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"title\": \"Generated schema for Root\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"ActualShipDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"ActualFulfillmentDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"OrderedQuantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"FulfilledQuantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"FulfillLineId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"ReturnableQuantity\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"ProductIdentifier\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"ProductDescription\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"DaysSinceFulfillment\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"ReturnEligibleFlag\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [          \n          \"FulfillLineId\",          \n          \"ReturnEligibleFlag\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"items\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "PrepareReturnOrderOutput",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let returnOrderData = $context.$nodes.GETRETURNORDERDATA.$output;\n\nif(returnOrderData.eligibleLines !=null && returnOrderData.eligibleLines.length > 0){\n\nlet policyValidationResponse = $context.$nodes.VALIDATERETURNORDERPOLICY.$output.items;\nlet eligibilityMap = new Map();\npolicyValidationResponse.forEach(item => {\n  eligibilityMap.set(item.FulfillLineId, item.ReturnEligibleFlag);\n});\n\nlet removedSum = 0;\n\nlet filteredEligibleReturnLines = returnOrderData.eligibleLines.filter(item => {\n  if (eligibilityMap.get(item.FulfillLineId) === \"No\") {\n    removedSum += item.LineAmount; \n   returnOrderData.nonEligibleLines.push({\n        \"FulfillLineId\": item.FulfillLineId,\n        \"DisplayLineNumber\": item.DisplayLineNumber,\n        \"ItemNumber\": item.ItemNumber,\n        \"ProductDescription\": item.ProductDescription\n    });\n    return false; \n  }\n  return true; \n});\nlet filteredEligibleReturnLinesPayload = returnOrderData.returnOrderPayload.returnOrderLines.filter(item => {\n  if (eligibilityMap.get(item.FulfillLineId) === \"No\") {\n    return false; \n  }\n  return true; \n});\n\nreturnOrderData.TotalReturnAmount = returnOrderData.TotalReturnAmount - removedSum;\nreturnOrderData.eligibleLines = filteredEligibleReturnLines;\nif(filteredEligibleReturnLinesPayload == null || filteredEligibleReturnLinesPayload.length ==0){\n   returnOrderData.returnOrderPayload =null;\n}else{\n    returnOrderData.returnOrderPayload.returnOrderLines =filteredEligibleReturnLinesPayload;\n}\n}\nreturn returnOrderData;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775414454755"
          },
